{"4114130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Asr Dreams: Revenge of the Lizards", "steam_appid": 4114130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a remote village deep in the desert. One day, you wake up to find everyone has vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/bc6476624eea074b930f546a0dd23de8.poster.avif?t=1763559689\" width=937 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/bc6476624eea074b930f546a0dd23de8.webm?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The peaceful days are in the past now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/fbeb476e8948bfea607098796aede9ac.poster.avif?t=1763559689\" width=936 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/fbeb476e8948bfea607098796aede9ac.webm?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/fbeb476e8948bfea607098796aede9ac.mp4?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night everything turns into horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/51bb2572818e398a863a84f6f95e8aa3.poster.avif?t=1763559689\" width=936 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/51bb2572818e398a863a84f6f95e8aa3.webm?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/51bb2572818e398a863a84f6f95e8aa3.mp4?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/5d23c7cfbb8a48737a11fdc48e5cede7.poster.avif?t=1763559689\" width=936 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/5d23c7cfbb8a48737a11fdc48e5cede7.webm?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/5d23c7cfbb8a48737a11fdc48e5cede7.mp4?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you let the horrors consume you, or hunt them through the shadows they crawled from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced First-Person combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and wield multiple weapons hidden through the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through hordes of mutated lizards in all shapes, sizes, and disturbing personalities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a remote village deep in the desert. One day, you wake up to find everyone has vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr