bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/5d23c7cfbb8a48737a11fdc48e5cede7.poster.avif?t=1763559689\" width=936 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/5d23c7cfbb8a48737a11fdc48e5cede7.webm?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/extras/5d23c7cfbb8a48737a11fdc48e5cede7.mp4?t=1763559689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you let the horrors consume you, or hunt them through the shadows they crawled from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced First-Person combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and wield multiple weapons hidden through the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through hordes of mutated lizards in all shapes, sizes, and disturbing personalities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Asr Dreams: Revenge of the Lizards is a first-person shooter horror-comedy. Uncover the mystery behind the lizards and stop their rampage before they annihilate the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/f38f6a4f697150de97ece1db61b2bf31b46d0b6d/header.jpg?t=1763559689", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114130/1b78bf5cce1b7c8b6fde0422f7c3935dade